		(property "Description" "RJ45 Ethernet jack with integrated magnetics and status LEDs. One shared symbol, two mount-style footprints: J_RJ45-HANRUN_TH (through hole, HY951180A/C34677, default) and J_RJ45-HANRUN_SMD (surface mount, HR961160C/C55683). Pin numbers are canonical across both footprints (SMD footprint pads were renumbered from the vendor's native numbering to match). When placing the SMD variant, override this instance's Footprint/MPN/LCSC Part/Datasheet fields to the _SMD values."
